<title>ANGOLA: PRESS DIGEST - Angola - April 21.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Angola - April 21.</headline>
<dateline>LUANDA 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Angolan press on Monday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>JORNAL DE ANGOLA</p>
<p>- Lights rains in the central Benguela province has threatened crops there, a provincial agriculture official said.</p>
<p>- Popular Angolan singer Bonga, a supporter of the former rebel UNITA movement and banned from government-held areas during the 20-year civil war, has left the capital Luanda for Lisbon where he lives.</p>
<p>--Luanda newsroom +2442 360-849</p>
